<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>救生艇新闻：博客——保护人类</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/</link><description></description><lastBuildDate>Sat, 12 Sep 2026 14:33:10 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>Maven Robotics 斥资 1 亿美元开发仓库机器人</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/maven-robotics-exits-stealth-with-100m-for-warehouse-bots</link><description>Maven Robotics 以 1 亿美元的 A 轮融资退出了隐秘行列。8 轮双臂机器人已经为财富 250 强客户进行 16 小时轮班运行。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/maven-robotics-exits-stealth-with-100m-for-warehouse-bots.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 12 Sep 2026 14:33:08 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/maven-robotics-exits-stealth-with-100m-for-warehouse-bots</guid></item><item><title>朱莉娅·兰伯特 (Julia Lampert) 谈 2035 年之前成为人工智能原生者</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/julia-lampert-on-becoming-ai-native-before-2035</link><description>&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/julia-lampert-on-becoming-ai-native-before-2035.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 12 Sep 2026 14:18:08 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/julia-lampert-on-becoming-ai-native-before-2035</guid></item><item><title>Helium-3 以更快的隧道速率提升新的量子计算概念</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/helium-3-lifts-new-quantum-computing-concept-with-faster-tunneling-rates</link><description>氦是最轻的原子，可以通过激光冷却和控制，为高性能、稳定的量子计算机的新设计提供动力。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/helium-3-lifts-new-quantum-computing-concept-with-faster-tunneling-rates2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 12 Sep 2026 14:03:08 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/helium-3-lifts-new-quantum-computing-concept-with-faster-tunneling-rates</guid></item><item><title>一种 RNA 核苷酸开关如何激活荧光染料</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/how-one-rna-nucleotide-switch-activates-fluorescent-dyes</link><description>RhoBAST 是一种微小的 RNA 分子，可以激活荧光染料，使研究人员能够以超分辨率追踪活细胞中的 RNA 分子。有机化学研究所的 Ronald Micura 和他的团队参与的一项国际合作现已表明，RNA 内的一个小型局部“核苷酸翻转”控制着这种荧光激活。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/how-one-rna-nucleotide-switch-activates-fluorescent-dyes2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 12 Sep 2026 13:48:08 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/how-one-rna-nucleotide-switch-activates-fluorescent-dyes</guid></item><item><title>单一纳米结构能够独立控制两种光共振模式</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/single-nanostructure-enables-independent-control-of-two-light-resonance-modes</link><description>金属纳米结构在将光集中到微小体积方面非常有效，而介电纳米结构则擅长以最小的能量损失存储光。传统上，结合这些互补特性需要复杂的混合结构，其中两种光学模式混合，使得它们难以独立控制。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/single-nanostructure-enables-independent-control-of-two-light-resonance-modes2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 12 Sep 2026 13:33:08 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/single-nanostructure-enables-independent-control-of-two-light-resonance-modes</guid></item><item><title>人工智能帮助寻找隐藏的人类蛋白质并揭示它们的作用</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/ai-helps-find-hidden-human-proteins-and-reveals-what-they-do</link><description>一项新的研究表明，人工智能与先进的实验科学相结合，可以帮助找到人体内“隐藏”和未开发的蛋白质，并揭示它们的实际作用。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/ai-helps-find-hidden-human-proteins-and-reveals-what-they-do3.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 12 Sep 2026 13:18:08 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/ai-helps-find-hidden-human-proteins-and-reveals-what-they-do</guid></item><item><title>堆肥微生物产生的酶可以处理聚氨酯泡沫和尼龙</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/compost-microbe-yields-enzyme-that-tackles-polyurethane-foam-and-nylon</link><description>奥尔胡斯大学和丹麦理工学院的研究人员采用了一种新方法来寻找能够分解一些最难回收的塑料类型的酶。他们从肯尼亚的一个垃圾填埋场、兰德斯雷恩斯科夫热带动物园、幼虫的肠道和奥胡斯附近的堆肥堆中收集了数百万个细菌，并检查了它们的酶。他们发现 12 个有效。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/compost-microbe-yields-enzyme-that-tackles-polyurethane-foam-and-nylon3.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 12 Sep 2026 13:03:08 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/compost-microbe-yields-enzyme-that-tackles-polyurethane-foam-and-nylon</guid></item><item><title>大脑衰老可能在症状出现前几十年就被发现，这与肠道健康有关</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/brain-aging-may-be-detected-decades-before-symptoms-appear-with-links-to-gut-health</link><description>加州大学洛杉矶分校的一项新研究发现，大脑衰老的速度与肠道中发现的细菌和化学副产品之间存在联系，这为了解在症状出现之前很久就导致大脑衰老的因素提供了线索。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/brain-aging-may-be-detected-decades-before-symptoms-appear-with-links-to-gut-health2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 12 Sep 2026 12:48:08 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/brain-aging-may-be-detected-decades-before-symptoms-appear-with-links-to-gut-health</guid></item><item><title>人工智能直接从固体力学数据中提取可解释的本构定律</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/ai-extracts-interpretable-constitutive-laws-directly-from-solid-mechanics-data</link><description>宁波东部理工学院（EIT）的研究人员开发了一种基于图的方法，可以直接从固体材料实验数据中提取简洁、准确的本构方程。研究， &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/ai-extracts-interpretable-constitutive-laws-directly-from-solid-mechanics-data2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 12 Sep 2026 12:33:08 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/ai-extracts-interpretable-constitutive-laws-directly-from-solid-mechanics-data</guid></item><item><title>不寻常的键重组钒材料的结构和磁性</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/unusual-bonds-reorganize-structure-and-magnetism-in-vanadium-material</link><description>虽然化学键通常决定材料的结构和性能，但相邻金属原子之间的键也会随着温度或其他条件的变化而变化。这些变化可能导致异常的电子和磁性行为。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/unusual-bonds-reorganize-structure-and-magnetism-in-vanadium-material2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 12 Sep 2026 12:18:08 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/unusual-bonds-reorganize-structure-and-magnetism-in-vanadium-material</guid></item></channel></rss>